## AI Agent Architecture (ALTO)

This project uses **ALTO** (Autonomous Lifecycle Task Orchestrator) for Claude Code multi-agent orchestration with human review gates.

### State Machine

```
PLANNING → IN_TASK → BETWEEN_TASKS → (repeat or COMPLETE)
              ↓
           BLOCKED (human review required)
```

### Agents

| Agent | Role | Model |
|-------|------|-------|
| `alto-planner` | Generate plan and tasks | opus |
| `alto-arbiter` | Human review gates | opus |
| `alto-backend` | Backend implementation | sonnet |
| `alto-frontend` | Frontend implementation | sonnet |
| `alto-qa` | Testing and fixes | sonnet |
| `alto-docs` | Documentation | haiku |
| `alto-gitops` | Git commits | haiku |
| `alto-reviewer` | Code review | sonnet |

### Directory Layout

```
CLAUDE.md                    # Orchestrator protocol
ARCHITECTURE.md              # This file
objective.md                 # Project goals

.claude/                     # Generated by devenv on import
├── settings.json
├── agents/alto-*.md
├── hooks/*.py
└── skills/alto-protocol/

runs/
├── state.json               # Current phase + task
├── plan.md                  # Task outline
├── tasks/                   # Task definitions
├── handoffs/                # Task outputs + context
├── arbiter/                 # Human review checkpoints
└── review/                  # Code review decisions
```

### Arbiter Thresholds

Configurable in `runs/arbiter/config.json`:

| Threshold | Default | Action |
|-----------|---------|--------|
| `max_lines_changed` | 2000 | BLOCK if exceeded |
| `max_files_changed` | 50 | BLOCK if exceeded |
| `token_checkpoint_interval` | 100000 | Checkpoint |
| `task_checkpoint_interval` | 3 | Checkpoint |

For full ALTO protocol documentation, see the [ALTO repo](https://github.com/YOUR_USER/alto).

